## Actions Generated

| # | Action | Details |
|---|--------|---------|
| 1 | Discovery | Find all OWNERSHIP held by non-hierarchy roles |
| 2 | Sanity check | Flag managed schemas where target role is not subordinate to schema owner |
| 3 | Transfer | GRANT OWNERSHIP ON ALL ... COPY CURRENT GRANTS per configured scope |
| 4 | Future grants | GRANT OWNERSHIP ON FUTURE to prevent regression on new objects |

## Important Reminders

- Run the sanity-check query (Step 2) before executing transfers — WARNING rows indicate incompatible target roles in managed-access schemas
- `COPY CURRENT GRANTS` is only valid on the bulk `ON ALL` form, not `ON FUTURE`
- This step **must complete before** Step 2.4 (Enforce Managed Access Schemas)

{%- else %}

